{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's a ridiculous idea to try and defeat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I’m so angry!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They told me to investigate the nature of",
                "these spirits flooding the surface…"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...but where do I even begin?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heyyyyy, Sanae!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Won't you lend me the shrine? Just for a bit."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "U-um, what for?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I want to make it a base for the beast youkai of the mountain.",
                "You’ll let me do that, won’t you, Sanae?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't be silly!",
                "Why would I ever..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Regardless, we don’t have a moment to lose."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "At this rate, we’ll be overrun by those weird beast youkai."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was just about to go investigate myself."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But still, I can’t just lend you our shrine."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, I’ll just help myself…"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Phantoms aside, there are beast spirits",
                "that we don't usually see here."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And the beast youkai are acting strange too,",
                "just as Tsukasa said."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is some sort of catnip-like substance ",
                "scattered all over the place?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, you're investigating too?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I thought the Moriya Shrine would be watching and waiting."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Strange beast youkai keep appearing, so I had to look into it."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Speaking of, a beast youkai like you is investigating too?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I guess you <i$could> call it an investigation."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, that's right."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lady Kanako told me to treat all beast youkai like enemies."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hahaha, that’s a good way of thinking.",
                "And a great way to an early grave as well!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems like I'll just have to keep",
                "reining in the beast youkai one by one."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Frankly, I don't trust the Moriya Shrine either."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Beasties, beasties!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Where are the beasties?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If they could come out of hiding right away,",
                "it would make my investigation a lot easier!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, somebody's in a good mood."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even though this neck of the woods is ",
                "crawling with rowdy beast spirits."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Finally, a beast youkai! With a big bushy tail too!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A beast youkai!?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What rudeness!",
                "How dare you call me a beast!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wha?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...What."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Whaaaat?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why're you running around, beating up beast youkai?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ummm, what was the reason again?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, that's right, I was investigating why ",
                "this land's spirits have been so turbulent lately."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I looked into it, and I found that not only phantoms ",
                "and beast spirits, but even beast youkai have been acting up."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So I decided to take down the beast youkai as fast as I can."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So that's the reason. I see."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In other words, it seems you haven't been ",
                "investigating the matter at all."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Listen. One or two beast youkai couldn't ",
                "possibly have started this incident."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm feeling kind. I'll let you in on something good."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It'd be a pity if you went home empty-handed",
                "after getting so worked up, dearie..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're as helpless as ever."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ummmm..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I followed Miss Mamizou's directions,",
                "but isn't this place..."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell?"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh no, was it all a trick?!",
                "That dumb tanuki!"
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And who might you be?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, aren't you the shrine maiden of that mountain shrine?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um, who were you again?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Matriarch of the Kiketsu family, Yachie Kicchou."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's quite unfortunate that I didn't leave an impression on you."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why have you fallen into Hell?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, it's... that tanuki..."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She told me that a beast youkai ",
                "is plotting the surface invasion here..."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Hah!? Could it be?"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hah, plotting an invasion?",
                "That's just wrong..."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We've gone past plotting stage. It's almost done.",
                "Soon, the surface will belong to the Kiketsu Family."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And when that time comes,",
                "I hope you remember the face of your ruler!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your invasion is... almost done?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's right. ",
                "We've acquired the strongest ally on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The weakness of we spirits of the Animal Realm, ",
                "needless to say, is that we lack flesh-and-blood bodies."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That is one of the reasons why we find it",
                "difficult to operate on the surface world."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Therefore, it's essential for us to make an ally ",
                "on the surface in order to extend our influence."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That ally of the Kiketsu Family from the surface...",
                "Where are they?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hehehe, and what're you gonna do with that information?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm eager to see what kind of",
                "stupid-looking face they have."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not going to hide her from you. If she's so weak that",
                "she loses to someone like you, she's of no use to us anyway."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She's in the Forest Sanctuary.",
                "Why don't you go and say hello to her?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That should engrave me, the ruler, in your memory."
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Isn't this around where the Forest of Sanctuaries should be?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've been told that it's full of cliquey types,",
                "and I shouldn't get too close, but..."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What if a Yamanba or something leaps out at me with a knife...?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, well..."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If it isn't the little lady from the Moriya Shrine."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How are you today?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, a stranger! What to do..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oops, sorry.",
                "We've never met before, now that I think about it."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm Son Biten, the Kiketsu family's guerilla agent."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am Gensokyo's one and only Great Sage, Heaven's Equal!",
                "Remember it well!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I can't believe it...",
                "What Miss Mamizou said was actually true."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The surface invasion has already begun..."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh-heh-heh."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This will be my great deed!",
                "I'm going to defeat you, and then..."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...save the world!"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Can you?"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Me and my monkey friends, we've all heard the rumours."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"That shrine maiden, from the new shrine? She's incompetent, less than a monkey!",
                "That dork can't do anything on her own,\" stuff like that."
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, come at me!",
                "But know I'm still learning how to keep my strength in check!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nice work!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seems like those rumors were unfounded."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This was fun!",
                "Let's go another round."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll pass, thank you."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just don't get it, why is a beast youkai from the surface",
                "lending a hand to spirits from the Animal Realm?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In my case..."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...it was all thanks to Lady Yachie that ",
                "I did not fall into Hell."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I must repay her kindness."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell...?"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Want to hear more about it?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um, yeah..."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then come closer."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "O-okay."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Close your eyes..."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "O-okay..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Like they said, you can't do anything."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Uh, um?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A youkai monkey told me to close my eyes, and then...",
                "What happened to me?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're awake."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've set a trap to deal with any hindrances who would interfere",
                "with the proper resolution of this incident."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you fell for it."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? A trap?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who might you be?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My name is Zanmu Nippaku."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The one who will quell the chaos that besets the surface."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your selfish actions have been deemed",
                "a hindrance in my eyes."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I only tried to thwart the Kiketsu Family's schemes."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's so selfish about that?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hah..."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You arbitrarily decided to intervene in the Kiketsu Family's schemes."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In other words, you were being selfish,",
                "wouldn't you say?"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmm?",
                "I-is that so?"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have fully settled the incident on the surface.",
                "There is nothing a human such as you can do."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now you must choose.",
                "Forget it all, or become nothing!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you chose to be nothing..."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That is also acceptable, I suppose."
            ]
        }
    }
}